Most small businesses across South Wales have their website hosted somewhere — but not all of them know exactly where, what's included, or who to call if something goes wrong. That's a common situation, and it's one we help with regularly.

## What we provide

NC Digital offers managed website hosting and security for small businesses across South Wales. We handle the infrastructure side so that business owners can focus on running their business rather than worrying about uptime, updates, or whether their site is secure.

Every website we host includes:

- Backups — automatic, regular, and stored offsite
- Uptime monitoring — so we're alerted if the site goes down
- SSL certificate management — encrypted, trusted connection for visitors
- Security monitoring — checking for vulnerabilities and malware

For WordPress sites, we host on Krystal — a UK-based host with a strong reputation for reliability and support. For managed starter websites, hosting and technical management are included as part of the monthly plan.

## Who we work with

We work with small businesses across South Wales — Merthyr Tydfil, Cardiff, Swansea, Newport, Bridgend, Pontypridd, and beyond. Many of our hosting clients are businesses we've built websites for; others come to us having outgrown or become unhappy with their current provider.

## Maintenance packages

For businesses that want ongoing management on top of hosting, our maintenance plans start from £50 per month. These cover software updates, security, and ongoing site care. The £75 per month plan includes up to five new pages added each month.

[Find out more about our hosting and security service](/services/website-hosting-security/) or [get in touch to discuss your website's hosting needs](/contact/).
